id: DRAFT-sciplot-0.3.1-cmake4-nested-policy-and-custom-target-test
severity: 2
category: toolchain|cmake|conan|testing
trigger_tool: cmake|conan
phase: configure|build
approach: (1) 嵌套测试子项目声明 cmake_minimum_required(<3.5) 时，CMake 4.x 拒绝；CMakeToolchain 的 tc.variables 设置 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 对子目录场景有效（toolchain 早于 add_subdirectory 加载），无需 cache_variables；(2) 上游用 add_custom_target(tests) 而非 CTest 注册测试时，cmake.test() 报 "No rule to make target 'test'"，配方 build() 直接 self.run 测试二进制

keywords: cmake_minimum_required, CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM, CMake 4, compatibility, nested subproject, add_subdirectory, add_custom_target, custom target, cmake.test, No rule to make target 'test', header-only, Conan 2

error_signature: Compatibility with CMake < 3\.5 has been removed|No rule to make target 'test'|cmake_minimum_required\(VERSION 3\.[0-4]
match_keywords: cmake_minimum_required,compatibility,removed,policy version minimum,custom target,test target

root_cause: (1) CMake 4.x 移除了 <3.5 的兼容策略；主项目声明 >=3.5 但嵌套测试子项目（add_subdirectory）声明 <3.5 时同样被拒；(2) Conan 2 的 cmake.test() 固定构建 CTest 约定的 test 目标，对 add_custom_target(tests) 自定义 target 项目无规则可执行

affected_scope: 主项目满足 CMake 4.x 但嵌套测试子项目声明 <3.5 的库；用自定义 target 注册测试的 CMake 项目的 Conan 2 配方；OHOS 工具链 CMake 4.1.2 必然触发

rec_priority: 1
similar_to: E321,E187,E103
caused_by: cmake4-policy-removal
conflicts_with: none
